WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.635
Signal now blocks

00:00:01.482 --> 00:00:02.614
AI from reading

00:00:02.425 --> 00:00:03.144
chats

00:00:03.678 --> 00:00:05.045
Signal says privacy

00:00:04.857 --> 00:00:05.753
is its mission

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:06.519
and it is

00:00:06.331 --> 00:00:07.392
now restricting the

00:00:07.204 --> 00:00:08.489
latest AI agents

00:00:08.312 --> 00:00:09.409
built into mobile

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:10.541
operating systems from

00:00:10.353 --> 00:00:11.885
capturing and storing

00:00:11.697 --> 00:00:12.746
your Signal data

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:14.142
It is blocking

00:00:13.954 --> 00:00:14.873
such capture by

00:00:14.685 --> 00:00:15.899
preventing screenshots

00:00:15.711 --> 00:00:16.312
in the app

00:00:16.136 --> 00:00:17.633
on iOS 27

00:00:17.716 --> 00:00:18.718
and when AI

00:00:18.529 --> 00:00:19.531
assistants attempt

00:00:19.343 --> 00:00:20.357
to capture screen

00:00:20.169 --> 00:00:21.395
data on Android

00:00:21.926 --> 00:00:22.680
It has done

00:00:22.492 --> 00:00:23.317
this before with

00:00:23.129 --> 00:00:24.461
Windows and for

00:00:24.273 --> 00:00:25.829
macOS 27 it

00:00:25.641 --> 00:00:27.173
recommends adding Signal

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:27.928
to the excluded

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:28.777
apps in Siri

00:00:28.589 --> 00:00:29.296
settings

00:00:29.814 --> 00:00:30.828
Full story on

00:00:30.639 --> 00:00:31.535
the dashboard
